### stage-peer-reviewer/SKILL.md
--- 1
Panel: five delegates, disjoint by perspective — `subagent` subagents (`subagent_type: general-purpose`, `model:` the PLAN tier value, omitted when empty), all five dispatched concurrently or in turn as the chair judges, and those it runs at once go out in one message (§6.1, §6.2). No question precedes it: fanning out is the chair's call and it does not ask (§6.1). Only a host that offers no dispatch, or one that refuses the call, takes the `quick` path — the meta-review then says `mode: quick`, which is the honest name for a panel that was never independent, and the digest names the fan-out that did not fire. Each brief contains
